AAPT2 natif aarch64 / Native aarch64 AAPT2
------------------------------------------
The native aarch64 AAPT2 binary is compiled from AOSP android-17.0.0_r1
using termux/android-build-tools (https://github.com/termux/android-build-tools).

  - Upstream build harness: https://github.com/termux/android-build-tools
  - AOSP source: https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base
  - License: Apache License, Version 2.0 (see native-build/LICENSE.txt)

The patch files under patches/ target the AOSP sources listed above and
inherit the Apache-2.0 license of the sources they modify. Each patch is
a minimal fix for compiling AOSP on aarch64 with a recent NDK/CMake.

